Scoped Audio Visual Research (AVR) demuxer

The 2BIT magic, the 128-byte header walk, the chan, bps, sign and 24-bit rate
semantics and the PCM codec-id mapping in src/avr.ts follow libavformat/avr.c
(avr_probe, avr_read_header), utils.c (ff_get_pcm_codec_id) and pcm.c
(ff_pcm_read_packet, ff_pcm_read_seek).
